OL,3,GNEWSAResidents say 'terrible smell' is
OL,4,Agetting worse
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Environment Agency said it was
OL,7,Finvestigating whether any regulated
OL,8,Fsites were contributing to the issue
OL,9,Fand would take action where necessary.
